        },
        {
          "text": "n'ibyungu by'izahabu makumyabiri byari dariki igihumbi, n'ibikoreshwa bibiri by'imiringa myiza isenwe y'igiciro cyinshi nk'icy'izahabu, ndabibashyikiriza.",
